o 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025, August to September came in at 42% of normal and September to October at 43% on the middle of the grids. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1956, at 59% to 60% of normal. For 2026 so far, March to April came in at 145% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
